- Table art/titan/lht1/lht1_hunt_skins.tres (ArtTitanSpriteSkins/ArtTitanSpriteSkin): by_titan hunt_01 → goblin, hunt_02 → dunkey, hunt_03 → golem; by_variant fallback golem/crystal/ancient → golem, horned → dunkey (fixtures use hunt_tiny, hunt_marsh).
- ProfileSettings.hunt_titan_style "3d"/"lht1" default "3d"; settings panel "Combat" section "Titans de chasse" with toggles %HuntTitans3D / %HuntTitansLht1 (texts "3D", "LHT1" untranslated); CombatPresenter.lht1_hunt_sprites set by combat_module from Session.settings before setup(); kind=="hunt" → sprite view; combat_preview.gd and titan_preview.gd accept option "lht1": true.
- Tests: test_combat_presenter (hunt+option → sprite view; MSQ & default stay 3D; position/death/escape/status/show_end on sprite view), art/tests/check_titan_sprites.gd, ProfileSettings round trip, settings toggle saves, test_code_rules: no res://lht_titans_extract reference. Captures combat.json combat_fight_lht1_*, combat_escape_lht1; titans.json titan_hunt_0{1,2,3}_lht1; re-check menu_settings_1280x720.
- Decisions: exception to D-032 (opt-in), ArtTitanActor, mapping; README third-party note.

