(kept here for reference; implemented later)
- @abstract class_name ArtTitanActor extends Node3D (art/titan/art_titan_actor.gd): signals death_finished, escape_finished; abstract play_walk, set_facing, play_hit, play_death, play_escape, reset_pose, set_status, is_status_active, get_hit_point, get_height, is_dead, size_scale. ArtTitanView extends it; presenter _titan/titan_view() typed ArtTitanActor.
